Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 19:44:11 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] A Rust crate as a native part: cargo_crate (Ferrous Goose
 0005)

A sidecar's cargo_crate names a crate using Ferrous Goose's
#[goose::export]; cargo goose native builds it and writes its module as
the sidecar loads, a build links its static library and a run builds the
JIT library from it. The program hands the crate the runtime's hooks.
